## Recorded with gifterm rec, then hand-edited:
##   - `npm run gt -- rec run-code.gt --cols 60 --rows 12`
##
## Check it like this:
##   - `npm run gt -- check run-code.gt
##
## Convert it to mp4 like this:
##   - `npm run gt -- render run-code.gt -o run-code.mp4

#cols 80
#rows 12
#char-speed 40ms
#line-speed 10ms
#raw-speed 10ms

P ~/Desktop/my-jetlag-tutorials $ 
D 80
C npm run serve -- my_game
D 80
N
L
L
L > jetlag@1.0.0 serve
L > node scripts/main.mjs serve my_game
L
R \e[1G\e[0K
D 170
R \e[32m\e[39m\r\n
L \e[32mServing at http://localhost:7000/my_game/my_game.html\e[39m
L   - The browser will auto-reload when code, assets, or an HTML file change
L   - Press \e[31mctrl-c\e[39m to stop the server
